                              <div class="row py-5 align-items-center align-items-xl-start">
                                   <div class="col-md-4 col-xl-2 mb-4 mb-xl-0 text-center text-xl-left">
			                         	<p><a href="/"><img alt="SGSC" class="logo mb-4 mg-lg-5" src="/img/sgsc-logo-dark-square.svg" /></a></p>

<ul class="list-inline social-media pt-1 pt-lg-0">
	<li class="list-inline-item"><a href="https://www.facebook.com/SouthGeorgiaStateCollege" target="_blank"><span class="fab fa-facebook-f" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="sr-only">Facebook</span></a></li>
	<li class="list-inline-item"><a href="https://twitter.com/southgastate" target="_blank"><span class="fab fa-twitter" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="sr-only">Twitter</span></a></li>
	<li class="list-inline-item"><a href="https://www.instagram.com/southgastatecollege/" target="_blank"><span class="fab fa-instagram" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="sr-only">Instagram</span></a></li>
</ul>

                                   </div>
                                   <div class="col-md-8 col-xl-4 pr-md-5 mb-5 mb-xl-0">
			                         	<h4 class="text-uppercase mb-4 mb-xl-5 h5" style="text-align: justify;">About SGSC</h4>

<p class="mb-3">South Georgia State College is a residential state college of the University System of Georgia focused on a core of strong teaching and personalized academic advising. It has a long and distinguished tradition of serving the people of Georgia. Students pursue associate degrees in 20 programs of study which transfer to other institutions or prepare them for careers in a variety of fields and five&nbsp;bachelor degree programs.</p>

<ul class="list-unstyled mb-0">
	<li class="mb-2"><a href="/about/accreditation">College Accreditation</a></li>
	<li class="mb-2"><a href="https://usg.edu" target="_blank">A University System of Georgia Institution</a></li>
	<li class="mb-2"><a href="https://www.usg.edu/policies/" target="_blank">University System of Georgia Policies</a></li>
	<li class="mb-2"><a href="/about/ethics-information">Ethics and Reporting Hotline</a></li>
	<li class="mb-2"><a href="/life-at-sgsc/student-compliant-process">Student Complaint Process</a></li>
